#N canvas 169 133 1438 875 transform 0;
#X text 30 20 'translate' shifts the origin and 'scale' multiplies the coordinates of everything drawn after it. 'scale' with one float scales both axes \, with two floats it scales them separately. 'reset' puts the origin and scale back., f 60;
#X text 30 85 Like the shapes \, these are part of the drawing list \, so they only affect the commands that come after them.;
